          "filename": "Los Angeles. Angels Flight. 2022-03-02 12-44-51.jpg",
          "caption": "Angels Flight is a narrow gauge funicular railway in the Bunker Hill district of Downtown Los Angeles, California. It has two funicular cars, Olivet and Sinai, running in opposite directions on a shared cable.\nThe funicular has operated on two different sites, using the same cars and station elements. The original Angels Flight location operated from 1901 until it was closed in 1969. The second Angels Flight location opened one half block south of the original location in 1996.",
